  "description": "Conquer Every Ride with the HovGtrs 1500W Full Suspension Electric Bike\nMeet the HovGtrs – a powerhouse moped-style electric bike built for both performance and comfort. With a 1500W high-torque motor, you’ll reach speeds of up to 32 MPH and enjoy a smooth ride even on rough terrain thanks to its full suspension design. Cruise up to 65 miles on a single charge and tackle hills effortlessly with a 90 N·m torque sensor that delivers natural, responsive power.\n\nDesigned to carry more, the HovGtrs supports up to 450 lbs payload, making it perfect for daily commutes, weekend adventures, or two-up riding. Stay connected with the HovGtrs mobile app, available on iOS and Android, for real-time stats, ride tracking, and more.\n\nWhether you're riding for speed, distance, or freedom – the HovGtrs is ready to elevate your journey.",
